{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Meat Company Commander, faced with a series of missions. You have five Veterans at your disposal, each with a different set of skills. Each completed mission grants you new abilities to deploy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat against overwhelming numbers of Bunglings (enemies) allows for a variety of tactics. Friendly fire, magic potions, and interactive board elements add variety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire action is set in a unique fantasy world, with stylized stop-motion animation and a story with a sense of humor. As the Meat Company Commander, how many veterans will you sacrifice to complete the mission? Or are you good enough to ensure everyone survives?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852180?t=1765377699","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852180?t=1765377699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852180/98f1576080bc69d90cbc7579a0c743be15c89229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765377699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852180/98f1576080bc69d90cbc7579a0c743be15c89229/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765377699","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4213700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Meat Company Commander, faced with a series of missions. You have five Veterans at your disposal, each with a differen